{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">漁護署副署長黎存志等聯同立法會議員，昨天到新界視察飼養山羊情況。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.GOAT-1830_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XZpjCN5rVT1791116684.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.GOAT-1830_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期間有數十隻山羊於公眾地方出現，部分無人看管，甚至走出行人路及馬路，沿途地上亦有羊糞。他們又到大埔一個私人農莊，了解小規模飼養山羊的實際情況，並探討如何在可控及妥善管理的環境下，飼養少量羊隻。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.GOAT-1830_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CTvNqBQDLW1791116671.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.GOAT-1830_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">署方正建議規管在新界，飼養綿羊、山羊及牛隻，希望可以妥善處理飼養活動可能帶來的滋擾、環境衞生及公眾安全問題。之後會諮詢立法會相關事務委員會，再敲定建議和相關法例修訂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T12:58:07.481658+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}